  "description": "FactoorSharp.FacturX.Validator provides validation support for Factur-X (ZUGFeRD) and XRechnung documents.\n\nIt enables automated validation of structured electronic invoices against expected formats and technical rules. The package is intended for scenarios such as invoice import, processing, exchange, and compliance checks.\n\nUse this package together with FactoorSharp.FacturX when your application requires validation of Factur-X (ZUGFeRD) or XRechnung files.",
